        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "BvVET",
          "name": "storySection",
          "width": 1440,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 48,
          "padding": [
            80,
            120
          ],
          "alignItems": "center",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "TDIKL",
              "type": "ref",
              "ref": "utk87",
              "name": "storyEyebrow",
              "descendants": {
                "YzlvI": {
                  "content": "THE ORIGIN"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "x4BHau",
              "name": "storyTitle",
              "fill": "$foreground-primary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": 880,
              "content": "A practice born at my own kitchen counter.",
              "lineHeight": 1.15,
              "textAlign": "center",
              "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
              "fontSize": 44,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "AKcPE",
              "name": "storyColumns",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 64,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "Qim47",
                  "name": "col1",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 24,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "o0Y3W",
                      "name": "p1",
                      "fill": "$foreground-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "For years I cleaned my home the way I'd been taught — with the bright bottles under every American sink. Then my youngest started coughing every Sunday evening, the day I always cleaned. I noticed the haze that hung in the kitchen long after I'd put the bottles away.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "XyyHI",
                      "name": "p2",
                      "fill": "$foreground-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "My marble counters were dulling. The grout was yellowing where the bleach had pooled. I was paying a premium to make my home feel less like home.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "HbsLg",
                  "name": "col2",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "layout": "vertical",
                  "gap": 24,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "N4D1F",
                      "name": "p3",
                      "fill": "$foreground-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Pure Home began as a series of test batches in mason jars — citrus rinds, white vinegar, castile soap, a few drops of essential oil. I started cleaning friends' homes on weekends, then their parents' homes, then a small boutique downtown. The waitlist arrived before I ever printed a card.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "e7CERo",
                      "name": "p4",
                      "fill": "$foreground-secondary",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Today, every product we use is plant-based, biodegradable, and sourced from a small batch supplier I can call by their first name. We are intentionally small, deliberately slow, and entirely uninterested in growing past the point of personal care.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.7,
                      "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "c5x2Zq",
              "name": "quote",
              "width": 920,
              "stroke": {
                "align": "center",
                "thickness": {
                  "top": 1,
                  "bottom": 1
                },
                "fill": "$border-strong"
              },
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 20,
              "padding": [
                40,
                32
              ],
              "alignItems": "center",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ca4nf",
                  "name": "quoteText",
                  "fill": "$foreground-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "\"I'd rather clean ten homes beautifully than a hundred adequately. That's the whole business.\"",
                  "lineHeight": 1.3,
                  "textAlign": "center",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-heading",
                  "fontSize": 32,
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "fontStyle": "italic"
